      "@id": "concept:project-cognition",
      "@type": "Concept",
      "label": "Project cognition (superseded early term)",
      "statement": "An early term for the evolving knowledge associated with a project or work. It was superseded because a represented work need not be a project and because the later concepts of Knowledge outcome and Semantic Artifact distinguish the generated knowledge from its governed representation more precisely.",
