      "@id": "concept:canonical-knowledge-base",
      "@type": "Concept",
      "label": "Canonical semantic knowledge base (superseded term)",
      "statement": "An earlier term for the authoritative structured representation from which projections and agent context are derived. It is superseded by Canonical semantic state, which avoids implying a particular database architecture and distinguishes the current represented state from the complete Semantic Artifact and its append-only history.",
