      "label": "Cross-domain handover and projection patterns",
      "statement": "Across domains, the same pattern recurs: a canonical semantic package transfers context to a new person or agent, declares the rules for continuing the work, and generates role-specific static or interactive views while retaining domain-specific authority and safety constraints.",
