      "@id": "source:author-clarification-generic-platform",
      "@type": "Source",
      "label": "Author clarification: generic core and semantic-first platform",
      "statement": "Saeid Mokaram clarified that the generic semantic-artifact standard must not contain publication-specific structure such as a conference-paper view. Publication is one application. He also proposed semantic-first platforms that replace or coexist with office and collaboration platforms by building governed semantic knowledge from heterogeneous organisational or personal sources and generating reports, presentations, code, and other outputs for particular needs or on demand.",
