    {
      "@id": "claim:reduced-translation-overhead",
      "@type": "Claim",
      "label": "Semantic collaboration can reduce repeated explanation and translation loss",
      "statement": "Directly providing governed semantic artifacts to an authorised agent can reduce the need for repeated meetings, manual restatement of requirements, individual absorption and reconstruction of another team's context, and re-priming of separate agents. The intended result is more complete and traceable use of available knowledge with fewer communication losses, not a guarantee that every relevant fact is captured or understood.",
