      "statement": "Saeid Mokaram clarified that work including research, ideation, brainstorming, development, creative practice, and artwork—whether performed by people, agentic systems, or combinations—can produce governed knowledge as its primary reusable outcome. Documents, images, reports, papers, code, designs, solutions, and other outputs can then be generated from that knowledge for particular needs.",
