      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "@id": "claim:source-preservation-for-future-interpretation",
      "@type": "Claim",
      "label": "Preserving original media enables future interpretation",
      "statement": "A transcript, OCR result, summary, feature vector, annotation, or current model interpretation captures only selected aspects of a source. Where policy permits, retaining or linking the original audio, video, image, sketch, sensor record, or other source allows later people and more capable future systems to recover cues, ask questions, or form interpretations that current extraction could not represent. New interpretations remain separately attributed derivatives and do not rewrite the source.",
