      "@type": "Claim",
      "label": "Required source modalities are governed by the application profile",
      "statement": "The generic approach must permit multimodal capture but does not require every work to retain every possible modality or raw recording. A domain or application profile and the responsible user or organisation should declare which sources are required, optional, linked, embedded, transformed, excluded, or deleted according to purpose, evidential value, consent, privacy, security, rights, storage cost, retention, access, and foreseeable future use.",
