      "@id": "instruction:preserve-source-derivative-distinction",
      "@type": "Instruction",
      "label": "Do not substitute an extraction for its source",
      "statement": "A reader or maintenance agent MUST distinguish an original source from its transcript, OCR, embedding, summary, annotation, feature extraction, or interpretation. It MUST NOT claim that a derivative exhausts the source's meaning, MUST identify unavailable or intentionally omitted modalities when material, and MUST record any new interpretation as a traceable derivative.",
