      "@type": "Source",
      "label": "Author clarification: accuracy, interoperability, and evolution remain open",
      "statement": "Saeid Mokaram clarified that the current work is a proposal whose evaluation remains open. Faithful capture must preserve facts and data, relations among facts, derivatives built from them, and relations connecting derivatives to their inputs. Whether this can be done accurately and whether the approach performs consistently across platforms require further development and testing. Broader community adoption and contribution should cause the approach to evolve over time.",
