    {
      "@id": "claim:output-refresh-is-task-and-risk-governed",
      "@type": "Claim",
      "label": "Update and review obligations depend on task and consequence",
      "statement": "A detected source change does not impose one universal response. Depending on the output type, purpose, authority, risk, and domain, the appropriate action may be no change, a notice, regeneration, manual editing through the semantic source, re-execution, tests, domain validation, withdrawal, or accountable human approval. High-consequence recommendations and executable derivatives require stricter currency checks and review than an informational historical view.",
