      "@id": "instruction:check-output-currentness",
      "@type": "Instruction",
      "label": "Check a retained output against its declared dependencies before asserting current validity",
      "statement": "When asked whether an earlier projection, recommendation, report, code artifact, or other derivative is still current, a reader agent MUST identify the semantic snapshot and dependencies used, compare them with the requested current state, report relevant changes and unknowns, and distinguish historical accuracy from present validity. It MUST NOT silently regenerate, alter, approve, or declare a consequential output safe without the tests and accountable review required by its task and domain.",
