      "statement": "At creation or release, the identified author, authors, organisation, community, or other legitimate releasing authority should declare how contributions and canonical decisions are governed. The generic semantic model requires that this policy be explicit and discoverable, but it does not require the same authority structure for every work or require the founding authority to retain permanent unilateral control.",
