    {
      "@id": "claim:contribution-channel-distinct-from-canonical-acceptance",
      "@type": "Claim",
      "label": "Permission to contribute is distinct from authority to change canonical state",
      "statement": "A governance profile may allow anyone, named participants, or authorised roles to submit attributed ideas, evidence, challenges, or corrections without granting each submission accepted canonical status. Open contributions can remain proposed, contested, or maintained in a review lane or fork until the declared acceptance process acts; a restricted profile may instead limit both submission and canonical writes to named authorities.",
