      "@id": "instruction:respect-declared-governance-profile",
      "@type": "Instruction",
      "label": "Respect and expose the artifact's declared governance profile",
      "statement": "Before proposing or applying a semantic change, an agent MUST retrieve the active governance profile and relevant historical policy state, distinguish permission to submit from authority to accept, and follow the declared review, approval, challenge, correction, release, and amendment rules. It MUST identify when no enforceable policy is represented and MUST NOT infer authority merely from technical write access or contributor presence.",
