    {
      "@id": "claim:federation-is-inspectable-within-represented-scope",
      "@type": "Claim",
      "label": "Federation should be fully inspectable within its represented scope",
      "statement": "Every mapping, transformation, conflict assertion, omission record, and joint derivation that participates in a federated result should be queryable with its inputs, provenance, method, creator or tool, time, status, confidence, policy, and history. This is full transparency of represented operations; it does not imply that tacit, inaccessible, uncaptured, wrongly encoded, or unknown information is visible or that the result is complete or correct.",
