    {
      "@id": "claim:federation-enables-multi-mode-probing",
      "@type": "Claim",
      "label": "Federated semantic results can be probed manually, automatically, and interactively",
      "statement": "Because participating objects, mappings, conflicts, gaps, and derivations are explicitly represented, authorised people and tools can inspect provenance, trace a joint conclusion, query a suspected omission, run automated consistency or constraint checks, compare alternative mappings, and explore the result interactively. A new person or future tool can challenge the federation without depending only on the narrative chosen by its original integrator.",
