    {
      "@id": "source:author-clarification-historical-knowledge-medium",
      "@type": "Source",
      "label": "Author clarification: historical-scale knowledge medium and epistemic reconstruction",
      "statement": "Saeid Mokaram clarified that the proposal's significance is not limited to efficient documentation. AI may make it practical to capture more first-hand and process-level knowledge, preserve the author's or producer's view alongside the represented underlying facts and sources, and let later people or systems reconstruct and interrogate more of the journey for themselves. At broad scale, he proposes this as a fundamental change in how humanity records and shares knowledge; at smaller scales, it may transform collaboration among people and machines. This prospective significance motivates aiming for prestigious general publications while remaining a claim to establish rather than a result already demonstrated by the semantic self-presentation.",
      "status": "authoritative-source",
      "review_status": "author-reviewed",
      "origin": "human",
      "evidence_level": "direct-source",
