      "@id": "argument:potential-historical-significance-supports-ambitious-publication",
      "@type": "Argument",
      "label": "Potential historical significance supports an ambitious publication strategy",
      "statement": "If semantic artifacts can materially expand first-hand capture, preserve a re-inspectable path from sources to interpretations, and change collaboration among people and machines, the contribution has potential significance beyond a documentation technique or one software tool. That scope justifies presenting the strongest defensible version to prestigious interdisciplinary venues. Venue prestige, however, follows from a precise novelty boundary, rigorous argument, functioning artifact, and credible evidence; the scale of the ambition alone does not establish importance or acceptance.",
