    {
      "@id": "source:author-clarification-ai-mediated-expression-capacity",
      "@type": "Source",
      "label": "Author clarification: AI-mediated expression and communication capacity",
      "statement": "Saeid Mokaram proposed that AI can help people overcome part of the physical and biological bottleneck between what they think or learn and what they can communicate to others. In this work, the proposed gain comes from assisting the capture, structuring, connection, preservation, retrieval, and task-specific expression of knowledge in a semantic artifact. He connected this idea to Neil D. Lawrence's account of humans as communication-bandwidth constrained relative to networked machines.",
