      "@type": "Source",
      "label": "Neil D. Lawrence, The Atomic Human",
      "statement": "Neil D. Lawrence's 2024 book The Atomic Human: Understanding Ourselves in the Age of AI contrasts evolved, embodied, communication-constrained human intelligence with machine intelligence and argues that their capabilities, limitations, and roles should not be conflated.",
