      "@id": "evidence:research-object-packaging-precedent",
      "@type": "Evidence",
      "label": "Whole-research-object packaging with human and machine views is an established precedent",
      "statement": "RO-Crate provides a linked-data package for describing a research object as a coherent whole, including methods, data, tools, workflows, inputs, outputs, people, organisations, provenance, and human-readable and machine-readable representations, with profiles for domain conventions. Generic packaging of a whole research activity and paired human-machine representation therefore cannot be claimed as new.",
