      "label": "Non-erasing event history, extensible lineage, and lifecycle integration are established precedents",
      "statement": "Event sourcing preserves changes as replayable events; OpenLineage captures job, run, and dataset lineage through extensible event facets; and NIST's digital-thread work connects lifecycle information for reuse and traceability in manufacturing. Append-only history, replay, extensible lineage, and lifecycle-wide traceability are therefore not individually novel.",
