      "@type": "Source",
      "label": "ICSE 2027 New Ideas and Emerging Results call for papers",
      "statement": "The official ICSE 2027 NIER call invites forward-looking, potentially groundbreaking software-engineering ideas supported by strong scientific intuition or promising preliminary results and concrete plans. It evaluates impact, novelty, relevance, rigour and presentation. Submissions use the IEEEtran 10pt conference format, allow four pages of main text plus one references-only page, require a section titled Future Plans, use double-anonymous review, and are due 23 October 2026 at 23:59:59 AoE.",
