      "label": "Author approval: semantic-first technology-team management application",
      "statement": "Saeid Mokaram approved adding the technology-team management application and its central formulation to the semantic work. The approved framing maps semantic artifacts to planning, prioritisation, delegation, progress monitoring, decision history, focused meetings, handover, risk management and reporting; uses a six-week feature-delivery case and a governed knowledge-gap loop; describes a shift from managerial information brokerage toward governance, judgement, prioritisation, conflict resolution and team development; and retains safeguards against surveillance, activity-based performance judgement, false completeness and displacement of leadership or human relationships.",
