          "decision_making": "Record the decision, options, evidence, objections, authority and later outcomes.",
          "meetings": "Generate agendas from unresolved conflicts, gaps and decisions requiring human interaction.",
          "handover": "Transfer architecture, decisions, evidence, risks, operating knowledge and open questions.",
