      "@type": "Source",
      "label": "Author request: portable five-file semantic-artifact bootstrap",
      "statement": "Saeid Mokaram requested a reusable folder containing five essential files that can be added manually to any future work and supplied to any capable agentic or conversational AI platform. The bootstrap must be provider-independent and person-independent in its operation, and it may include a generic initiation prompt. This source concerns a reusable projection of the methodology; it does not make the methodology author the authority of artifacts created from it.",
