      "statement": "A separable, provider-independent view tool that loads a conforming semantic artifact and supports interactive navigation, search, questioning, relationship tracing, provenance and history inspection, and task- or goal-specific projection. The Explorer reads the artifact through its declared exchange and query contracts; it is neither the semantic-artifact methodology nor the canonical source of the knowledge it presents.",
