    {
      "@id": "decision:explorer-is-separate-view-tool",
      "@type": "Decision",
      "label": "Keep the Explorer separate from the semantic-artifact core",
      "statement": "The Semantic Artifact Explorer is maintained as a distinct application and reusable view tool, not as a required part of the generic semantic-artifact kernel, the identity of a represented work, or its canonical state. Its interface should be able to load independently created conforming artifacts. Other explorers and interfaces may implement the same open contracts without depending on this implementation.",
