    {
      "@id": "instruction:explorer-output-is-noncanonical",
      "@type": "Instruction",
      "label": "Explorer output is noncanonical unless explicitly accepted",
      "statement": "An Explorer may retrieve, arrange, explain and generate views from a loaded artifact, but its answers, layouts, summaries and projections do not silently alter canonical knowledge. A proposed correction, interpretation or new fact may enter an artifact only through that artifact's declared contribution, review and acceptance process, with attribution and a non-erasing event record.",
