      "@id": "source:author-clarification-multi-artifact-workspace",
      "@type": "Source",
      "label": "Author clarification: multi-artifact workspaces and framework references",
      "statement": "Saeid Mokaram clarified that a person, agent or Explorer-like tool should be able to load and work with multiple semantic artifacts simultaneously. The combined workspace can propose connections between their represented knowledge, reveal conflicts and disagreements, and support creation of a new larger semantic artifact. The Semantic Artifact Framework may be made available to future works as a stable reference for the general method, while each task-specific artifact refers to the relevant framework release and concepts as needed.",
