      "@type": "Claim",
      "label": "Multi-artifact operation belongs to the generic framework",
      "statement": "The ability to load, reference, compare and jointly use multiple semantic artifacts is a generic Semantic Artifact Framework capability. An Explorer may implement it as a view and interaction tool, but the semantic rules for identity, releases, references, mappings, authority, conflicts, derivation and source boundaries do not belong to that particular interface.",
