      "@type": "Concept",
      "label": "Cross-artifact reference resolution modes",
      "statement": "A cross-artifact reference declares one of three resolution modes: live resolves according to the target artifact's declared current-release policy; pinned identifies an exact immutable target release; materialized includes a source-preserving copy in a derived package while retaining the exact originating artifact and release.",
