    {
      "@id": "question:semantic-artifact-document-equivalent-and-token-efficiency-evaluation",
      "@type": "Question",
      "label": "What document-equivalent and token-efficiency benefit does a Semantic Artifact provide?",
      "statement": "For a declared Semantic Artifact snapshot and scope, what is the smallest observed conventional document or document corpus that preserves the required semantic coverage and fidelity, and how does its storage, task-time context, repeated-use, maintenance and update cost compare with full-artifact and retrieval-based Semantic Artifact use? Under what tasks, models, retrieval methods, fidelity thresholds and numbers of repeated uses does the Semantic Artifact save model-visible tokens while maintaining or improving answer quality, traceability, uncertainty recognition and contradiction recovery?",
